        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 04-A2 Stainless Steel Industrial Design Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStainless steel industrial design door knob, Fusion Hardware's 04-A2 is available in either brushed or polished stainless steel finishes. The simple shape allows for this modern stainless steel material door knob and rose set to look great in both contemporary loft type apartments and  homes. It is backed by a lifetime warranty. Adjustable to fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors. Optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-industrial-design-entryset-fusion-04-a2-100-a2-bss\"><b>Industrial Design Door Knob Lockset</b></a> for your exterior doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 04-A2 Industrial Design Door Knob With Contemporary Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Simple 04-A2 Stainless Steel Industrial Design Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter:  2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection:  1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter:  2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection:  3/8”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
